@startuml
title UC-1 격자 맞추기 — 제품 유스케이스
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Solo Player" as player
rectangle "표시 중인 맵에서 격자 맞추기" {
  usecase "격자 맞추기" as align
  usecase "기준점 조절" as origin
  usecase "한 칸 크기 조절" as size
  usecase "미세 조정" as refine
  usecase "확대경으로 원본 확인" as magnify
  usecase "적용" as apply
  usecase "취소" as cancel
  usecase "저장 실패 안내" as failure
  usecase "재시도" as retry
  usecase "다시 보정" as reedit
}

player --> align
player --> reedit
align .> origin : <<include>>
align .> size : <<include>>
align .> refine : <<include>>
magnify .> origin : <<extend>>
apply .> align : <<extend>>
cancel .> align : <<extend>>
failure .> apply : <<extend>>
retry .> failure : <<extend>>

note right of align
  이미 공개된 영역만 표시한다.
  기존 플레이 상태는 변경하지 않는다.
  저장된 정렬을 초기값으로 사용한다.
  R1-R6, UC-1·UC-2·UC-3
end note
@enduml
